---
title: Aunt Terri's Cheesy Potatoes
source: Aunt Terri
servings: 10
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 60 minutes
---

Mix @frozen hash browns{36%oz}, @sour cream{1%cup}, @cream of chicken soup{1%cup}, and @shredded cheese{2%cups} together in a #13x9 pan{}. Bake at 350 degrees for ~{1%hour} or until hot and bubbly.
